      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c1c8e54f866947e9eaec268|full_name}: Thanks for showing the math behind it. Now it makes sense, I should have approached it like that before.\nNow my question is, why the value in the Debug Menu (Ingame > Options > Config > Debug) is rounding up to 0.2, and my Animator uses that value, but other people see the raw value of ~0.196?\nThat kind of confused me, I guess.\nMaybe the floats locally are more precise? And 8 bit floats are sent via Networking.\nBut now I atleast know how to workaround it appropriately, thanks.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
